          "text": "A 20-second breath opens Limit Max on A (16→34) while it closes on B (34→12), so the sensation leans from one channel to the other. Four bell sequencers with 4, 3, 2.5 and 2 s steps ring in polyrhythm on the four segments: high pitch plays soft, low pitch plays hard. A floor of 14 on A means it never fully lets go while touched."
